	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Guh... Gaahhh...!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The golem's fist slams me to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not yet... Not yet!”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Another heavy fist falls down upon me, crushing my entire body.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Even then, the golems are not satisfied.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Though my body is already mangled beyond recognition, they continue brutally swinging their fists down.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Countless shadowy golems stand before me.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Hundreds, thousands, millions─",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Their forms rise up from the black snowfields as far as the eye can see.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"All of them are karmic distortions that once fell upon Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"To fulfill my covenant with Kuronushi-no-Ookami, I have continued to fight ever since the day I descended to this place.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"How long has it already been since I left Akari behind?",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“How about you take a break already?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Either way, the two of us are trapped here forever.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Not yet...)”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Though my voice box is crushed, I rasp out my refusal.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Not yet!)”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not done yeeeeet!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Despite being pulverized to a half-liquid state, I stand up and reform myself into the shape of a human.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haah... haah...! Ah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Aren't you a real bundle of energy?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari is waiting for me.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hahahahaha, you seriously think you can go back?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You can never kill me.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“In other words, you can never fulfill your covenant with Kuronushi-no-Ookami. Isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I'm well aware.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"But still, I will fight.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Even now, Akari must be hard at work building up a new Empire.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"So I cannot afford to rest myself.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Refocusing my consciousness, I grip my blade tight─",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"A resplendent burst of color appears before my eyes─",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"An element wholly foreign to this desolate, monochrome world of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Reaching out my hand, I touch the petals glowing with warm light.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The sky suddenly breaks through the dark clouds of snow I thought would never clear.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“No way... The clouds, they're...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"A dazzling white light pours out from the great azure beyond.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Shining down with a radiant compassion that has never been known in Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"This pristine, pellucid light, I recognize it─",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"The same purifying light that struck down the priestess Sekka in Inner Iseya─",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The light of Oomikami.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			hide=1,
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"My child's tears of Persica hath",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"traveled far to reach me.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"A resonance far too overwhelming to call a voice fills the world.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"It resounds not simply in my ears, but throughout each and every constitutive element of my body.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			hide=1,
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"O Kuronushi-no-Ookami,",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[48]={
			hide=1,
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I repent for having long defiled",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Thy land.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[49]={
			hide=1,
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"The covenant Thou hast made with",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my subject, I shall now fulfill in",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"full.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[50]={
			hide=1,
			{
"I COULD WISH NOTHING MORE",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			hide=1,
			{
"ALL I SEEK IS STILLNESS",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"His",
{"/font"},
" divine light bathes the world, and\nKuronushi-no-Ookami's joyous voice echoes out across the endless fields of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"In the next moment, all the karmic distortions covering Ne no Kuni evaporate in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Not only that─",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Like fallen snow melting in the spring sun─",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Kahaku and I begin to disappear from the feet up.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"As I close my eyes, all my senses begin to slowly, sweetly unravel.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"The karmic distortions are no more, and Kahaku and I will soon follow.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Oomikami has relieved me of my fight that ought to have continued unto eternity.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Why did He deign to exercise His power for the likes of me?",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"From what I gather from His words, Akari's tears must have moved Him to compassion.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Even though she promised me she wouldn't cry anymore.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I hear a faint voice from far away─",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"A voice calling out to me.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Following the voice in my heart, I reach out toward the sky.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Even as my hand grows faint, I feel a definite power pulling me up.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"As though rescuing a drowning man, the invisible power guides me higher and higher towards the light.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Huh? What's the meaning of this?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kahaku stares up at me in wonder as I drift into the sky.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The faint voice becomes clearer.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"It's the cry of an infant.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Why does it stir my heart so?",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The mere sound of it fills my chest with an irreplaceable radiance, invigorating my hazy consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"It's my child─",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Our",
{"/font"},
" child, still inside Akari.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Transcending all reason, that conviction repeats itself within me, again and again.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"─My child is crying.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"─I have to protect it.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"─I have to be there by its side.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm coming!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I reach with all my might towards the source of that voice.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ghh?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"A ferocious force suddenly pulls down on my leg.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It's not very nice of you to run away on your own.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Haven't we cast our lot together?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let me go!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I'm unable to extricate my leg from his viselike grip.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The two of us are tools of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“We dance and dance for them, and once we outlive our usefulness, they cast us aside. Isn't that how it works?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Kahaku drags me down, and the infant's voice grows distant.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"But I can't afford to give up.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I will not lose that voice.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"That voice that proves I am not a mere tool─",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"The proof that I am human!",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You and I are different!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I... am a human!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ahahahaha! Don't make me laugh!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You were born as a tool, and you'll die as a─?!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Suddenly, my body grows lighter.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Did Kahaku release me?",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"No, that's not it.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Someone",
{"/font"},
" has pinioned Kahaku's limbs.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"My other self─",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“How... can this...?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"As though my soul is departing from my body, a separate being falls down to Ne no Kuni with Kahaku in his arms.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"The ageless, undying avatar of the battlefield─",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"He who cuts down all calamity befalling the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"“Mine” existence as a tool fades together with Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Leaving behind only a simple warrior.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"An ordinary human tossed about by the billowing tides of his emotions─Tokita Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Fare thee well, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The last sight I see is his untroubled, radiant smile.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Lying on the cool cobblestones, I stare vacantly at the changing sky.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Dawn will soon break.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The dark blue sky is tinged with a pale violet on the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I realize that my surroundings are buried in peach petals.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"All of them, my tears.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I've never cried so much before.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"It feels like I've cried an entire lifetime's worth of tears.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Now I won't have to cry anymore for as long as I live.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"But even if my tears haven't run dry, I don't think I'll cry anymore regardless.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"After all, there will never be anything or anyone as near and dear to me as Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Perfect.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"I'll be just like ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"her",
{"/font"},
"─someone who cast aside her feelings and discarded her tears to become a true Empress.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All right, about time I head back to the palace.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"A mountain of official duties is sure to be awaiting me, just like always.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I force myself upright as I try to clear my head.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...?!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Still half-seated, I suddenly freeze in place.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"This melody...",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"I'll never forget it, not in a million years.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The whistling draws closer and closer─",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ka... haku...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"I draw my blade and grip it tight with trembling hands.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Soujin isn't here anymore.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"The only thing I have to rely on is my own strength.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"I scrabble to my feet and turn to face the source of that voice.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"My breath catches in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Illuminated by the rising sun, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"he",
{"/font"},
" is standing right there.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"He who should have set off for Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like I just can't get the hang of whistling.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"He shows me a terribly awkward, clumsy smile.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"The instant his familiar voice reaches my ears, I start running─",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I catch Akari in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I missed you so much... Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So did I, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I stroke her hair as she presses her head into my chest.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"My body trembles with joy at her softness, her warmth.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I've finally returned.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"─How long has it been?",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"─What happened while I was gone?",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Shoving these needless questions aside, all I do is hold Akari tight.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you ever go anywhere again.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll stay by your side forever.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if you order me to go away, I'll stay by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know I'd never say that to you.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Akari glares reproachfully at me.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
