			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your eyes are swollen.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Didn't you promise me you wouldn't cry anymore?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you think it's your fault for making me cry?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, you're right. It's all my fault.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry I made you sad.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's okay. It's all okay now.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just having you back... is all I ever...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"How hopelessly dear she is to me; her warm embrace, her tearful voice─",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Welcome home, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
